    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONQUISTADOR REX</h2><br>3 spaniard conquistadors lost in an unexplored region of \u200b\u200bAmerica full of jurassic creatures and other enemies. <br><br>Conquistador Rex is a challenging 2D tactical platform game to play alone or in local co-op with a fantasy and historical setting.<br><br>And if you just want to enjoy it without frustration, the &quot;Explorador&quot; mode will allows you to save the game at any time without losing its challenging essence.<br><br><br><br>Be ready to beat 10 long and challenging levels carefully designed with great characters and enemies drawn by hand.<br><br>You will have to combine the different skills of the three main characters to advance. Will challenge your intelligence, reflexes, memory and sense of direction.<br><br>Think carefully about each step to get back home!<br><br>A tribute to 3 ancient vikings.<br><br><br><br>---<br><br>* 2 Control pads are required to play local multiplayer.<br><br>* Online multiplayer is also avalible through &quot;Remote Play Together&quot;.<br><br>* Conquistador Rex is also compatible with SteamDeck, SteamOS and Linux. <br>If you have any problem running the game directly from Steam, follow system instructions (down).",
